TEXT 80 48 Left 3 ;#324 50 microamp Wilson current source
TEXT 80 112 Left 2 ;Source: Alan Wolke (W2AEW), https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TQ7w6_CgO0Q
TEXT 80 160 Left 2 ;A 6.4 V reference and three PNP transistors regulate current through the meter movement.
TEXT 80 904 Left 2 ;Vdut stands in for the 50 uA meter movement. Sweeping it maps the source's compliance range.
TEXT 80 960 Left 2 !.param TRIM=4.12k
TEXT 80 1000 Left 2 !.dc Vdut 0 5 0.05
TEXT 640 960 Left 2 !.meas dc IDUT_250MV FIND I(Vdut) AT=0.25
TEXT 640 1000 Left 2 !.meas dc IDUT_5V FIND I(Vdut) AT=5
